# The APKs in this directory are committed on purpose.
#
# They are synthesised by ../make_fixture_apk.py (a few kilobytes each, no target data)
# and they are the input of tests/test_so_constpatch.py, which pins the contract that
# scripts/so_constpatch.py must keep when it rebuilds an archive: STORED stays STORED,
# extra / external_attr / create_system survive, and resources.arsc keeps its 4-byte
# alignment. The repository-wide `*.apk` rule exists to keep pulled samples out of the
# tree, which is a different thing from a generated fixture.
!*.apk
